        <!-- Common Mistakes -->
        <div class="mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">Common Mistakes When Buying a Treadmill at Academy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">None of these is unique to Academy, but its written policies make each one easy to avoid.</p>
          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Building it before you are sure</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Academy's 60-day returns are for unused items in original packaging, unless something is faulty. Test in store first, and keep the box until you know you are keeping the machine.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Assuming the treadmill ships free</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Academy's free shipping offers exclude bulk and heavy items. Check the delivery charge for the level you want at checkout and compare the delivered price with other retailers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Asking for a match on the wrong model</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The price match needs the same brand and model number from a qualifying retailer. Compare item numbers first, and remember that manufacturers' own sites are not on Academy's online list.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Choosing door delivery without a plan</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Basic delivery stops at the door. Unless you choose a higher level, arrange help to carry a heavy box inside and up any stairs before the truck arrives.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

